WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.537
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.489 --> 00:00:06.267
Eddie needs a toy from inside Sammy, but Sammy is locked!

3
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:10.169
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:12.786
This is Episode 39.

5
00:00:12.786 --> 00:00:15.571
Maya could give Eddie a name tag.

6
00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:18.801
Then Eddie could open Sammy any time.

7
00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:20.530
Even at night.

8
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.099
Even when nobody is looking.

9
00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:25.140
That is too much.

10
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.370
So Maya hands him a badge instead.

11
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.386
Eddie clips it on.

12
00:00:30.386 --> 00:00:31.659
Click!

13
00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:33.616
Sammy opens.

14
00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.849
Eddie takes one toy.

15
00:00:35.849 --> 00:00:38.815
Then he hands the badge right back.

16
00:00:38.815 --> 00:00:40.087
Click!

17
00:00:40.087 --> 00:00:42.212
Sammy locks again.

18
00:00:42.212 --> 00:00:44.289
Eddie keeps nothing.

19
00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:46.690
Borrow it for one job.

20
00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.743
Give it straight back.

21
00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:51.120
That is the borrowed badge.

22
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.762
Now you know IAM roles!

23
00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:57.990
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

